   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Buying with discernment",
     "texto": [
      "**Forbruk** is consumption. **Bærekraftig** describes something that can be maintained in the long term with less environmental impact. **Matsvinn** is food that is thrown away without being used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reducing waste",
     "texto": [
      "**Gjenbruk** is reuse; **resirkulere**, to recycle. **Engangs-** means single-use, as in **engangsplast** (disposable plastic)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
